        <mxCell id="footer" value="Drawn from origin/main 9ac9e42 (2026-10-21) and the open pull requests named on it, dashed yellow (#85 and #92 change only IAM policies, #116 renames a variable, #129 narrows a security group; none adds a resource). Not drawn: terraform/proving-ground and the terraform/ root module - validated in CI, applied by no pipeline. Pausing the runtime (/warden/ops/tf/paused) removes the ECS services, the NAT and the alarm intake; the data stays. One incident in detail: incident-flow.drawio · identities: architecture-detailed.drawio page 2 · delivery: delivery.drawio." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#52606D;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
